  "caveats": [
    "sd7 for the directional class rests on three wallets; the honest range is 1.7 to 3.0 pts.",
    "Scaling by sqrt(T/7) assumes independent weeks; autocorrelated regimes make the true MDE larger.",
    "Heavy tails (one market maker at -21 % in 7 days) inflate the sample sd to 8 pts; the discovery-time market-maker filter is what makes the smaller sd applicable.",
    "The matched-random baseline shares the market regime with the target, which is why paired differences rather than raw returns are the primary measure."
